<http://www.reuters.com/article/2014/10/10/us-gt-advanced-tech-bankruptcy-apple-idUSKCN0HZ00B20141010> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/publishing#genericJson> "{\"id\":\"http://www.reuters.com/article/2014/10/10/us-gt-advanced-tech-bankruptcy-apple-idUSKCN0HZ00B20141010\",\"feature-set\":[],\"document-parts\":{\"feature-set\":[{\"name\":{\"type\":\"XS_STRING\",\"name\":\"isDebugMode\"},\"value\":{\"type\":\"XS_BOOLEAN\",\"value\":\"true\"}},{\"name\":{\"type\":\"XS_STRING\",\"name\":\"sentimentScore\"},\"value\":{\"type\":\"XS_DOUBLE\",\"value\":\"0.481375510075\"}},{\"name\":{\"type\":\"XS_STRING\",\"name\":\"summary\"},\"value\":{\"type\":\"XS_STRING\",\"value\":\"Apple given time to block info in GT bankruptcy case: ruling | Reuters\"}},{\"name\":{\"type\":\"XS_STRING\",\"name\":\"title\"},\"value\":{\"type\":\"XS_STRING\",\"value\":\"Apple given time to block info in GT bankruptcy case: ruling\"}},{\"name\":{\"type\":\"XS_STRING\",\"name\":\"encoding\"},\"value\":{\"type\":\"XS_STRING\",\"value\":\"UTF-8\"}}],\"document-part\":[{\"feature-set\":[],\"id\":\"0\",\"part\":\"ALL\",\"content\":{\"text\":\"Apple given time to block info in GT bankruptcy case: ruling | Reuters\\n\\n\u00A0\\n\\n\\nA general view of an Apple store in the Manhattan borough of New York September 7, 2014.\\n\\n(Reuters) - Apple Inc ( AAPL.O ) will have at least three days to review and potentially move to bar any information about its relationship with GT Advanced Technologies Inc ( GTAT.O ) that may arise during the latter's bankruptcy hearings, the court said in a ruling on Thursday.\\n\\nGT Advanced, which struck an agreement last year to supply sapphire for Apple's iPhone and other mobile devices, filed for bankruptcy on Monday.\\n\\nIn Thursday's ruling, U.S. Judge Henry Boroff said GT Advanced should provide any reasonable information as part of the case, \\\"except that in the event that any such information relates to the details of the debtors' business relationship with Apple.\\\"\\