<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing#Mention-4e4c9aadf255d0e937eca52158e90bd3ef3554f22a07559ca6a78298134470b3> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/publishing#text> "\"There are fierce clashes and they are bombing the centre of Kobani from afar,\" he said" .
