<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing#Mention-7b51baca87991a0ee9282e1fb50087c5e5346892e52b683a428f3cea0a6eeab7> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/publishing#text> "\"I believed in the peace process, because I didn't want any more children to die. But the Kurds were fooled. The peace process was insincere. The government either wants to wipe out Kurds or to enslave them,\" said Ahmet Encu" .
