<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing#Feature-5866bdd0-1738-47fa-9211-557056d93862> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/publishing#hasValue> "0.33305690157142853" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_i_could_probably_have_died_there_in_corner_one_if_it_had_been_10_cms_closer_to_my_head_if_the_technology_is_there_and_available_and_there_is_the_possibility_i_would_not_exclude_it_for_sure_he_said> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"I could probably have died there in corner one if it had been 10 cms closer to my head. If the technology is there and available,\u00A0and there is the possibility, I would not exclude it, for sure,\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_it_s_a_difficult_one_said_2009_champion_jenson_button> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"It's a difficult one,\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_it_s_quite_a_room_simon_shaw> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"It's quite a room,\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_he_s_one_of_those_artists_like_painter_francis_bacon_who_s_been_reappraised_and_with_hindsight_he_is_understood_to_have_captured_or_represented_a_particular_historical_moment_in_the_way_that_andy_warhol_represents_the_1960s_jeff_koons_the_1980s_or_damien_hirst_the_early_2000s_shaw_said> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"He's one of those artists like (painter Francis) Bacon who's been reappraised and with hindsight he is understood to have captured or represented a particular historical moment in the way that (Andy) Warhol represents the 1960s, Jeff Koons the 1980s or Damien Hirst the early 2000s,\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_their_vision_was_entirely_their_own_said_oliver_barker> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"Their vision was entirely their own,\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_to_receive_an_honor_related_to_foreign_policy_means_a_great_deal_to_me_as_it_is_what_i_wish_to_dedicate_my_working_life_to_she_said> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"To receive an honor related to foreign policy means a great deal to me, as it is what I wish to dedicate my working life to,\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_we_really_like_the_canada_model_which_is_really_unlike_any_other_in_the_world_said_christian_groh_a_co_founder_of_seattle_based_private_equity_firm_privateer_holdings_one_of_the_largest_players_in_the_medical_marijuana_sector_what_we_re_doing_here_does_not_violate_local_state_and_federal_law_in_canada_> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"We really like the Canada model, which is really unlike any other in the world. What we're doing here does not violate local, state and federal law (in Canada).\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_that_is_two_violations_of_u_s_federal_law_i_don_t_see_there_is_any_way_around_that_white_said> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"That is two violations of U.S. federal law. I don't see there is any way around that,\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_the_larger_institutions_have_a_lot_to_lose_and_face_a_lot_of_scrutiny_because_of_everything_else_they_do_said_brian_vicente_a_partner_at_vicente_sederberg_in_denver_they_are_not_interested_in_taking_that_risk_at_this_moment_and_that_opens_up_space_and_opportunities_for_smaller_firms_> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"The larger institutions have a lot to lose and face a lot of scrutiny because of everything else they do. They are not interested in taking that risk at this moment, and that opens up space and opportunities for smaller firms.\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_some_investors_look_at_this_and_think_i_m_getting_in_on_the_ground_floor_i_m_going_to_be_part_of_the_next_facebook_of_marijuana_and_timing_is_everything_i_can_buy_in_low_and_eventually_sell_super_high_when_legalization_hits_said_hilary_bricken_a_lawyer_at_seattle_based_harris_moure_that_day_may_never_come_> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"Some investors look at this and think, 'I'm getting in on the ground floor. I'm going to be part of the next Facebook of marijuana, and timing is everything. ... I can buy in low and eventually sell super-high when legalization hits,' \"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_gdp_growth_is_expected_to_slow_to_around_7_3_percent_in_the_third_quarter_as_property_investment_growth_slides_and_manufacturing_deflation_worsens_tang_jianwei> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"GDP growth is expected to slow to around 7.3 percent in the third quarter as property investment growth slides and manufacturing deflation worsens,\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_as_we_move_into_the_fourth_quarter_the_base_effect_is_expected_to_become_slightly_more_favorable_this_can_support_a_path_of_modest_expansion_qu_hongbin> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"As we move into the fourth quarter, the base effect is expected to become slightly more favorable. This can support a path of modest expansion,\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_the_possibility_of_cutting_interest_rates_and_rrr_within_the_year_is_not_big_unless_there_is_a_ugly_turn_said_zhang> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"The possibility of cutting interest rates and RRR within the year is not big, unless there is a ugly turn,\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_there_should_be_a_lower_limit_if_quarterly_growth_slips_below_7_percent_policy_should_be_changed_said_zhang_yongjun> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"There should be a lower limit. If (quarterly) growth slips below 7 percent, policy should be changed,\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationOrganizationQuotation/_i_feel_great_and_really_excited_starboard> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"I feel great and really excited,\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationOrganizationQuotation/_shockingly_olive_garden_no_longer_salts_the_water_it_uses_to_boil_the_pasta_merely_to_get_a_longer_warranty_on_its_pots_starboard_said> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"Shockingly, Olive Garden no longer salts the water it uses to boil the pasta, merely to get a longer warranty on its pots\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationOrganizationQuotation/_any_place_to_hide_asked_bmo_capital_markets_analyst_ambrish_srivastava_in_a_note_to_clients_for_the_time_it_appears_not_> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"Any place to hide?\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_what_s_happening_nowadays_with_people_pointing_to_the_unemployed_as_problematic_is_dangerous_laurent_berger> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"What's happening nowadays, with people pointing to the unemployed as problematic, is dangerous,\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_if_they_were_discussing_the_amount_of_payouts_then_we_would_have_something_more_similar_to_the_hartz_4_reforms_in_germany_said_dominique_barbet_european_economist_at_bnp_paribas_for_the_time_being_they_are_moving_ahead_with_baby_steps_trying_to_avoid_fraud_> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"If they were discussing the amount of payouts, then we would have something more similar to the Hartz 4 reforms in Germany. For the time being, they are moving ahead with baby steps, trying to avoid fraud.\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_the_shared_characteristic_these_funds_have_is_they_have_not_been_doing_so_well_since_2008_said_janet_yang_a_fund_analyst_at_morningstar_the_question_is_if_the_markets_had_gone_down_would_they_have_made_these_changes_> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"The shared characteristic these funds have is they have not been doing so well since 2008. The question is if the markets had gone down, would they have made these changes?\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_our_concern_is_that_this_is_happening_after_a_pretty_good_run_in_the_equity_market_said_lori_lucas_defined_contribution_practice_leader_at_callan_associates_a_san_francisco_based_consultant_to_institutional_investors_if_it_s_a_reaction_to_the_fact_that_some_target_date_funds_haven_t_been_competitive_then_it_is_a_concern_> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"Our concern is that this is happening after a pretty good run in the equity market. If it's a reaction to the fact that some target date funds haven't been competitive then it is a concern.\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_there_is_some_kind_of_expectation_that_we_are_making_these_changes_because_of_the_equity_markets_or_because_of_what_competitors_are_doing_and_that_is_incorrect_said_chip_castille> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"There is some kind of expectation that we are making these changes because of the equity markets or because of what competitors are doing and that is incorrect,\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_none_of_our_work_was_saying_hey_the_equity_markets_did_well_we_should_be_in_equities_jensen_said_it_was_about_if_we_have_a_dollar_today_how_do_we_want_to_put_it_to_work_based_on_what_our_capital_markets_assumptions_are_telling_us_> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"None of our work was saying 'hey the equity markets did well, we should be in equities. It was about if we have a dollar today, how do we want to put it to work based on what our capital markets assumptions are telling us.\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_the_decision_was_supported_by_our_view_that_the_global_macro_environment_had_become_more_stable_post_the_financial_crisis_said_john_miller> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"The decision was supported by our view that the global macro environment had become more stable post the financial crisis,\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_we_see_these_as_a_way_to_get_a_decent_yield_now_and_high_likelihood_into_the_yield_growing_substantially_in_the_future_said_scott_moore> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"We see these as a way to get a decent yield now and high likelihood into the yield growing substantially in the future,\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_we_ve_seen_a_lot_of_interest_in_yieldco_stocks_as_of_late_given_the_sharp_pullback_in_the_names_which_seems_driven_by_their_limited_liquidity_and_some_global_growth_worries_she_said> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"We've seen a lot of interest in yieldco stocks as of late given the sharp pullback in the names, which seems driven by their limited liquidity and some global growth worries,\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_the_role_of_a_sponsor_as_a_growth_driver_grows_in_importance_as_public_yieldcos_multiply_inflating_the_value_of_contracted_renewable_power_projects_the_yieldcos_relying_predominantly_on_third_party_acquisitions_for_growth_should_therefore_rush_to_secure_growth_projects_even_if_they_feel_that_current_project_valuations_look_bloated_she> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"The role of a sponsor as a growth driver grows in importance as public yieldcos multiply, inflating the value of contracted renewable power projects. The yieldcos relying predominantly on third party acquisitions for growth should therefore rush to secure growth projects, even if they feel that current project valuations look bloated,\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_for_me_the_big_worry_about_these_assets_is_that_they_will_have_to_reinvest_incredibly_well_over_time_to_justify_their_prices_said_edward_guinness_who_runs_the_guinness_atkinson_alternative_energy_fund_and_invests_in_several_solar_companies_i_am_skeptical_as_to_whether_in_20_years_time_these_companies_will_be_persevering_and_returning_capital_at_the_forecast_rates_> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"For me the big worry about these assets is that they will have to reinvest incredibly well over time to justify their prices. I am skeptical as to whether in 20 years time these companies will be persevering and returning capital at the forecast rates.\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_he_was_greek_like_all_stray_animals_loukanikos_somehow_reflected_the_restlessness_of_greeks_who_refuse_to_bow_down_anna_makri> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"He was Greek. Like all stray animals, Loukanikos somehow reflected the restlessness of Greeks who refuse to bow down,\"" .
<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_while_we_often_have_good_intentions_before_we_go_to_a_restaurant_i_m_going_to_get_the_side_salad_instead_of_fries_when_we_arrive_a_lot_of_cues_can_prime_us_to_want_to_indulge_these_include_the_smells_what_our_companion_eats_and_now_perhaps_even_the_weight_of_our_companion_brian_wansink_told> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"While we often have good intentions before we go to a restaurant (I'm going to get the side salad instead of fries), when we arrive, a lot of cues can prime us to want to indulge. These include, the smells, what our companion eats, and now perhaps even the weight of our companion,\"" .
