<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_i_ve_just_set_up_camp_here_under_the_bridge_and_i_will_come_down_to_occupy_whenever_i_can_said_wong_lai_wa_23_i_may_have_to_go_back_to_school_during_the_day_but_i_will_make_every_effort_to_come_back_> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"I've just set up camp here under the bridge and I will come down to occupy whenever I can. I may have to go back to school during the day, but I will make every effort to come back.\"" .
