<http://data.ontotext.com/publishing/RelationPersonQuotation/_do_you_remember_srebrenica_we_do_we_never_forgot_and_probably_we_never_forgave_ourselves_said_de_mistura_the_u_n_peace_envoy_for_syria_when_there_is_an_imminent_threat_to_civilians_we_cannot_we_should_not_be_silent_> <http://ontology.ontotext.com/taxonomy/relationText> "\"Do you remember Srebrenica? We do. We never forgot and probably we never forgave ourselves. When there is an imminent threat to civilians, we cannot, we should not, be silent.\"" .
